      "prompt": "The following information is given to you to prepare an itinerary for Mrs Donna Chang,\nsenior sales officer, who will be travelling over the period 10–12 July 2017.\n— Sunday 10 July, Mrs Chang will leave home at 0600 hours on Marley’s taxi #34. Check\nin at Caribbean Airlines desk, Norman Manley International Airport at 0645 hours.\nDepart flight CA 414 to Grantley Adams International Airport, Barbados at 0845 hours.\nEstimated time of arrival (ETA) at Grantley Adams 1145 hours. Take taxi to Bridgeport\nHotel, Christ Church. Confirmation of booking attached. Meals booked. Quotation\nprepared for OJM Industry Ltd. Rest of day free.\n— Monday 11 July, Breakfast meeting at hotel at 0700 hours with Mr S. Mace, local\ncompany representative. Notes attached for discussion prior to meetings. At 0830\nhours, meeting at regional office with sales department representatives. Agenda\nattached. Luncheon at Sandale Hotel at 1200 hours hosted by the Kiwanians. Transport\nby company car. 1400 hours meeting at Sandale hotel in the conference room with client\nSKR Manufacturing Ltd. Correspondence attached in portfolio. 1630 hours return to\nhotel by taxi.\n— Tuesday 12 July at 0700 hours, depart hotel by taxi to Grantley Adams airport, 0730\nhours check-in at CA desk; 0930 depart Grantley Adams CA 415 to Norman Manley;\n1230 hours estimated time of arrival, Jamaica, to be met by company car.\nUsing an appropriate format, prepare the itinerary for Mrs Donna Chang in the spaces provided\nbelow and on page 12.\n(8 marks)",
